      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Much easier: hide lens when it's fixed on the camera box. There is no point to keep it visible because we know camera is there. Other modes, where camera is unlocked and can moved around, then the lens will visible. \nThat should good enough for most cases.\nThis camera unlock is controlled by yellow button. Not orange button where how camera is pointed at you. Panorama / follow mode will also make lens visible.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
