  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-30T08:20:02.030Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One of the most annoying things about the camera is the default mode, which follows wherever you're pointing it, always has the camera lens intrusively blocking the middle of the screen. I believe the lens should be moved to the top of the screen instead. Picture related as to my proposed change",
